  "description": "* EMAIL ENQUIRY ONLY*\n\nA well-proportioned 2-bedroom duplex apartment located in the well-maintained development of Coolagh Well, just off Beamore Road in Drogheda. This property offers comfortable living across two levels and is ideally situated within easy reach of Drogheda town centre and the M1 motorway.\n\nKey Features:\n\nTwo double bedrooms with built-in wardrobes\n\nOpen-plan living and dining area\n\nFully equipped kitchen with modern appliances\n\nMain bathroom with bath and shower\n\nNon-designated parking within the development\n\nCommunal green areas\n\nConvenient access to local amenities including Tesco Extra, schools, and public transport\n\nPlease note: The bed currently located in the kitchen area is being removed before new tenants move in. The property is currently occupied, and some items visible in the photos belong to the current tenant and will not remain in the property.\n\n* EMAIL ENQUIRY ONLY*",
